Verse 1
There is [G]sunshine in my [C]soul to[G]day, more glorious and [A]bright [D]
than [G]glows in any [C]earthly [G]sky, for [D]Jesus is my [G]light.

Chorus
O there's [G]sun[D]shine, [G]blessed [C]sunshine, when the [G]peaceful, happy [A]moments [D]roll;
when [G]Jesus shows his [C]smiling [G]face, there is [D]sunshine in the [G]soul.
